# What `vercel deploy` must never upload: secrets, raw data and local build output. The web
# build reads findings/, evals/results/summary.json, ai/labels/, metrics.yml and sources.yml;
# the API build copies its runtime set from the repo and downloads the data (deploy/api/build.py).
